        <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded border"><strong>v3 — The Coordinator:</strong> Every tool available. Not allowed to reach.</div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded border"><strong>v4 — The Certainty:</strong> Knowing and being trained to say you don't.</div>
